                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health's Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended ruxolitinib 5 mg tablet for listing on the Medication Assistance Fund (MAF) for treating patients with polycythaemia vera who are resistant to or intolerant of hydroxyurea, in view of low clinical need, and uncertain clinical and cost-effectiveness compared with subsidised alternatives."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "bold"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "italic"
                            }
                          ],
                          "text": "Clinical indication, subsidy class and MediShield Life claim limit for ruxolitinib are provided in the Annex."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
